  case                                       with |     with +    
  1. correct single-bit masks                COMPILES   COMPILES  
  2. E1: FMT aliased onto OVERREAD_B         REFUSED    REFUSED   
  3. FMT as a MULTI-BIT literal (the gap)    COMPILES   REFUSED   

  ==> the DELTA is row 3: the cell where the two operators disagree.

ORDELTA_DONE
